ttps://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622325_982378414761080_6297121199269376974_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eQB96AgeoNsQ7kNvwE5lERT&_nc_oc=AdoKh86xuFiwIrceAj2ldKquvrJzrTZfWtWvYxgjNPOyQGvYC2blO26P-jBssIQNN4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFVQXTBrgceZZEITfRs-bpWd2dGA7tV8mD1yg2_ttAIuA&oe=6A7DD1B8"}]}, "id": "1350042019889396", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "screenshot1.png", "id": "2672691649768837", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820001_2672691653102170_6070227746444721464_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=skoH5NnT1LkQ7kNvwHuyfL1&_nc_oc=AdrZUAUyjPlqzawLVauz1Qp6gChm_lcWlDkn9JpBYYWig01vms4srKPnbvaE_s3vyMY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF3y0NDinjGP1yx2xVB5LmDhBSnmiaxr6B4Za_XYmrCZQ&oe=6A7DA8B8"}, {"file_name": "screenshot2.png", "id": "1645642236781921", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_1645642240115254_4780819430018594941_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pzB1zoewFFoQ7kNvwEsOQ9R&_nc_oc=AdqJl0iNaCmWcOmvBcedGCY5J5zW1qPuAkLSEARIy_KWW_XpuVY4-xNPOEzNIZArjpA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH0EgsIQknGWxlmRHE5maN4I5y-u4uckDFtpHdy3tS1Iw&oe=6A7DC7B5"}, {"file_name": "screenshot3.png", "id": "2003970736853004", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622276_2003970740186337_7038040051001963756_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fcHom9mjfekQ7kNvwEhYd20&_nc_oc=Adpc-my1zN5TCctjnAIYeUJGXzK2-uwZTXhEz8edbO17xYJVDuYNBwMmXbgDGMiGQVo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGIFNxRp4Ce5gJew5UEiFfCoJ0xGO2qbuYRK2EZNnr4hg&oe=6A7DAD92"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "1617185392819750", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_1617185396153083_4871439775798051847_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RU0hSEH28pMQ7kNvwE0-ib3&_nc_oc=AdqAVqLn4MPLPG7jx7UxyJXHhExQfmdiKygox6P5b3uo5uni4tbfOrppjjB59pszIgg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEeakEZACUCJI88RbP072vdj_osn4fP6YNaeyDnVUQ4nQ&oe=6A7DB443"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "927392076591193", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619148_927392079924526_6503803113885199451_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kQulxPFFgpAQ7kNvwHJgqrJ&_nc_oc=AdoWRVkHTPK8H7xnh4GLScqjiZoZ2as0mQMB5L6q2nDKNJTSZE5pIdCg1b9NYYQLY1Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFWpFysdeN-6lqOygF_yla5IsgklDJUwvAJ5p1UIXVJrQ&oe=6A7D9CEA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rehamaru", "keywords": ["rehamaru", "rehabilitation", "cognitive", "training", "assessment"], "long_description": "**About Rehamaru**\n\nRehamaru is a Mixed Reality application for rehabilitation professionals in medical and long-term care settings. Using Meta Quest hand tracking, it enables conventional paper-based assessments and training to be performed in an MR environment.\n\n**Included Applications**\n\n* **Number Cancellation**: An assessment task for attention and executive function in which users select numbers or letters in sequence. MR enables a three-dimensional approach to attention in real space.\n* **Selective Cancellation**: A task for assessing selective attention.\n* **Whack-a-Mole**: A training task for reaction speed and attention in which users hit appearing targets with their hands.\n* **Maze**: A task that uses spatial cognition and executive function to reach the goal.\n* **Quiz**: A task for checking orientation to date, day, and time.\n* **Object Search**: A task in which users search for designated objects.\n* **Hanamichi**: A walking-based spatial cognition training task.\n* **Select Touch**: A rhythm-based movement task.\n\n**Main Features**\n\n* Supports **Assessment Mode** and **Training Mode**\n* Targets cognitive functions such as spatial cognition, executive function, memory, attention, orientation, and working memory\n* Works with a dedicated controller application for program and session record management\n\n**Important Information**\n\nThis application is **not** a medical device. It should be used only as a supplementary tool under the supervision of rehabilitation professionals. A dedicated controller application is required.", "short_description": "Rehamaru is a Mixed Reality (MR) rehabilitation support application developed for medical and nursing professionals.\nIt utilizes Meta Quest's hand tracking function to provide a variety of training and assessment programs related to cognitive and upper limb function.\nIt includes many rehabilitation contents such as number cancellation, selection cancellation, volleyball, whack-a-mole, and mazes."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cover1440x1440_jp.png", "id": "2267283124103757", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622325_2267283127437090_5618732659148961051_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=79UXCkcGgVoQ7kNvwEbKMg1&_nc_oc=Adpkqu_z70bFr98wxGIIWCutNzd54Po1ssVT0tPhmmiWzs_pgEglcRVtfgpB9Dh9Uac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFOZhoTTfnMShKltKwLgsSwxLo36-sGoxf3JKGKSADj0Q&oe=6A7DA7A4"}, {"file_name": "RehamaruWorld_white.png", "id": "1307626311282892", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618499_1307626314616225_9098268127185132166_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZA-QtdNm8RQQ7kNvwHcNF2H&_nc_oc=AdqdRDpSjyCsGo97VChpAY4rHY2E5_eHuvnKzAmjCDfseHR64l6mTA-XIip4MqU9FHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFmWMAWWQflUqoGE2qIt1T5MyPQvHMqUftlDMR04pjHqQ&oe=6A7DACAF"}, {"file_name": "cover2560x1440_jp.png", "id": "1252867780007107", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499315353_